#: app.py:863
msgid "Instructions d'utilisation"
msgstr "Usage instructions"

#: app.py:864
msgid "compare_instructions"
msgstr ""
"1. Prepare a plain text file with references to be compared with the currently loaded ORCID profile. "
"**Separate each reference with an empty line.**\n"
"2. Upload this file using the dialog underneath.\n"
"3. Once references have been extracted, you can use the slider to adjust the confidence threshold between "
"references from the uploaded file and those present in the ORCID profile.\n"
"4. Select references that appear to be missing from the ORCID profile and will need to be added.\n"
"5. Export the selected references and add them manually to the ORCID profile. The (experimental) BibTex "
"export can directly be loaded into the ORCID works section."

